				\begin{document}$$EQ - 5D_{index } = 1 - 0 \left( {MO1} \right) - 0.019 \left( {SC2} \right) - 0.048 \left( {UA3} \right) - 0.319 \left( {PD4} \right) - 0.394 \left( {AD5} \right) = 0.220$$\end{document}EQ-5Dindex=1-0MO1-0.019SC2-0.048UA3-0.319PD4-0.394AD5=0.220
